IgnoreUnknown UseKeychain
UseKeychain yes
AddKeysToAgent yes

###
# Hosts
###
Host github
  User git
  HostName github.com
  PasswordAuthentication no

Host codeberg.org
  User git
  HostName codeberg.org
  PasswordAuthentication no

Host bitbucket
  User git
  HostName bitbucket.org
  PasswordAuthentication no
